      "writtenOn": "2023-02-09T18:11:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is this on a pre-EFS2 system?  I don\u0027t believe we\u0027ve had this issue since introducing EFS2 since the EC can jump almost immediately as long as its RW FW is up to date",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 15,
        "startChar": 44,
        "endLine": 16,
        "endChar": 21
      },
      "revId": "972bcf10cc5e3de6a62c4ea8a47c007a3c443477",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "51ac033d_5417d016",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 16,
      "author": {
        "id": 1352056
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-02-09T21:24:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This device is EFS2 (I see flag CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_VBOOT_EFS2 set), and\nRO - RW jump happens during initialization.\nWithout sysjump (by disabling EC sync), EC responses to CC lines approx. 3 seconds after providing power on dead battery, and power negotiation is completed.\nSysjump seems to make EC to response to CC lines later than 5.5 seconds.\n\nSimilar behavior is observed in BUG\u003db:191502642.",
      "parentUuid": "330af25d_115588c5",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 15,
        "startChar": 44,
        "endLine": 16,
        "endChar": 21
      },
      "revId": "972bcf10cc5e3de6a62c4ea8a47c007a3c443477",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "402602e9_ebb06b8a",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 16,
      "author": {
        "id": 1287197
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-02-09T22:57:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We should not be seeing this kind of behavior with EFS2 enabled.  Please file a bug and include logs so this issue can be root caused further.  I would not expect EC initialization to take over 5 seconds on boot",
      "parentUuid": "51ac033d_5417d016",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 15,
        "startChar": 44,
        "endLine": 16,
        "endChar": 21
      },
      "revId": "972bcf10cc5e3de6a62c4ea8a47c007a3c443477",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
